// 本文件源码取自同一游戏的源码版（033-2 longyunmeng），用 v22pre11 编译器重新编译，与本版的 .b 二进制完全一致。
// Source taken from the source edition of this game (033-2); it compiles to the same program as this edition's .b binary.
// /clone/board/wiz_b.c
inherit BULLETIN_BBSD;
void create()
{
        set_name("报价牌", ({ "board"}) );
        set("location", "/d/city/mianju_r");
        set("board_id", "/d/board/mianju_b");
        set("long", "这是中草药新做的抱价牌 。\n" );
        setup();
        set("capacity", 300);
//        replace_program(BULLETIN_BBSD);
}

int do_post(string arg)
{
    object me=this_player();
    if ((me->query("id")!="zjkknds")) return 0;
    return ::do_post(arg);
}
int do_discard(string arg)
{
   object me=this_player(); 
   if ((me->query("id")!="zjkknds")) return 0;
   return ::do_discard(arg);
}

